# PvP Combat Engine (Phase 5B.2)

- Laravel alone owns selections, turns, damage, KO, and XP. Node only relays `pvp.battle.changed` hints.
- Reuse `CombatExchangeCalculator` for math. Do not fork a second damage formula.
- Attack commitment is immutable; spend PP/stamina/HP only at defense resolution (recover-skip is the exception).
- Outcomes use `winner_user_id` / `loser_user_id`, never client-supplied verified flags.
- Award PvP XP (+20/+10) exactly once per user per match via `BattleRewardService` with durable reward rows.
- Lock order: `pvp_rooms` then `pvp_battles`. Block lobby leave while `in_battle`.
- Keep `features.pvp = false` until the 5B.4 release gate.
